{"user": "I think so? I don't see any way for white to flip the discs, aside from the one they'd get from the corner. So I'd get 6 - 1 discs, 5 discs over white for giving them the corner.", "user_ts": "2026-08-21T20:41:08.978903+00:00", "assistant": "That\u2019s a reasonable thing to test \u2014 but count it as a **sequence**, not just \u201c+5 for a corner.\u201d\n\nAfter **g2**, if White plays **h1**, White flips **g2 back**, so your new g2 disc doesn\u2019t stay. Then the remaining empties are mostly on the left/bottom: **a1, a3, b6, a7, b8, c8**.\n\nKey question: after **g2 \u2192 h1**, does Black still get the last good moves, or does White\u2019s corner/mobility let them win the remaining empties? Try looking one move further for Black after White\u2019s h1.", "assistant_started_ts": "2026-08-21T20:41:26.890024+00:00", "assistant_ts": "2026-08-21T20:41:28.899633+00:00", "annotation_user": {"final": ["Think Aloud", "Metacomment"], "consensus": ["Think Aloud", "Metacomment"], "votes": {"Think Aloud": 3, "Metacomment": 2}, "confidence": {"Think Aloud": 1.0, "Metacomment": 0.6666666666666666}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Think Aloud"], "llama": ["Think Aloud", "Metacomment"], "sonnet": ["Think Aloud", "Metacomment"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_review": false, "arbiter_used": false}, "annotation_assistant_fine": {"final": ["Board Report", "Worked Line", "Hint", "Prompt", "Neutral Feedback"], "consensus": ["Board Report", "Worked Line", "Hint", "Prompt", "Neutral Feedback"], "votes": {"Board Report": 3, "Worked Line": 3, "General Principle": 1, "Hint": 3, "Prompt": 3, "Neutral Feedback": 3}, "confidence": {"Board Report": 1.0, "Worked Line": 1.0, "General Principle": 0.3333333333333333, "Hint": 1.0, "Prompt": 1.0, "Neutral Feedback": 1.0}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Board Report", "Worked Line", "General Principle", "Hint", "Prompt", "Neutral Feedback"], "sonnet": ["Board Report", "Worked Line", "Hint", "Prompt", "Neutral Feedback"], "llama"